load @term/seed/code/manifold/riemannian
  find riemannian-manifold

# The osculating plane: at a point of a curve in space, the plane that best fits the curve there, spanned by its
# velocity and acceleration, the plane the curve momentarily bends within. It is part of the moving frame that measures
# how a curve twists and turns. The form carries the manifold the curve lives in.
form osculating-plane
  link manifold, like riemannian-manifold
